KFcT_Al2OzhdJszLQZwYlm5AW_6VCOxq-TVFFKIg&oe=6AFB33F0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440_1_V3.png", "id": "1950798478807203", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300678_1950798482140536_7887888194729868798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8vtfADcAiBgQ7kNvwHd9aRx&_nc_oc=Adq0sSMm-xoqXF-DPHu7g0ieyr_fz0397ea_6fo0gzrgceEbtvqSuMiMcNNgW89witE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBmQBcOsnG_7vazgNyTGYjrTIM1IhTG0dvq6_WK8FHpw&oe=6AFB3964"}, "display_name": "EchoSphere", "keywords": [], "long_description": "EchoSphere is an immersive experience focused on presence, interaction, and discovery.\n\nPlayers engage with an atmospheric environment designed to encourage curiosity and intentional movement rather than fast-paced action or direct combat. The experience emphasizes spatial awareness, rhythm, and interaction with systems that respond to player behavior.\n\nEchoSphere is designed for seated, standing, or room-scale play and does not require rapid physical movement. The experience currently does not contain competitive co-location multiplayer, but may in a future update.\n\nThe main application is intended as a self-contained VR experience and does not require an internet connection for core functionality.", "short_description": "An immersive, exploratory VR experience focused on presence, interaction, and discovery."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/liminalinteractive/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Liminal Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.liminalityinteractive.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQU